# Secrets live in .env* files and never in git (security-baseline #251).
.env
.env.*

# Per-machine Claude Code session state — worktrees, plans, transcripts.
# Never tracked; it is machine-local and meaningless to anyone else.
.claude/

# Per-machine override escape hatch.
CLAUDE.local.md

# NOTE: CLAUDE.md itself is TRACKED and must stay so — it is the shim that
# @-imports AGENTS.md. Ignoring it would silently stop Claude Code loading the
# repo's instructions at all, which is why owen-ops's conformance scan asserts
# this file does NOT list it.

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
